{"version":1,"key":"card:652","content":{"id":652,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在琢磨 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":651,"contentId":4906,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"破窗效应"}]},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"content-link","refId":649,"contentId":4900,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"滑梯效应"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，我发现这两个概念非常相似：它们都在强调“第一步”——无论是打破第一扇窗，还是踏上滑梯的顶端，都会让事态不可避免地滑向混乱。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但仔细拆解后，会发现两者的侧重点其实大有径庭："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"破窗效应","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：更侧重于"},{"type":"formatted","text":"环境的暗示作用","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。它在探讨一种社会心理，即一个破败的信号（第一扇破窗）是如何诱发群体性的放任，最终导致犯罪或秩序崩塌。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"滑梯效应","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：更侧重于"},{"type":"formatted","text":"行为的惯性力量","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。它解释了为什么一旦你主动迈出了那一步，就会产生一种“身不由己”的加速度，让你极难在中途止损，只能直奔深渊。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"callout","title":"举个例子","calloutType":"info","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想象你在尝试“减肥”这件事："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"破窗效应","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"是：你看到桌上已经堆满了别人吃剩的包装袋（破窗），于是心想“反正这屋子已经这么乱了，大家都在吃”，你也跟着撕开了一包薯片。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"滑梯效应","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"是：你心软对自己说“就吃这一口”（迈出第一步），结果这一口多巴胺瞬间击垮了你的意志力，让你根本停不下来，最后演变成暴饮暴食的一顿大餐。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}]}],"tags":["概念对比"],"createTime":1767144500750,"updateTime":1767178840175,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767178840175},"links":{"card:651":{"key":"card:651","type":"card","id":651},"card:649":{"key":"card:649","type":"card","id":649}}}